    <li>Open on-site cards for orientation, then lift the <strong>canonical marketplace URL</strong>—not a screenshot—from the live listing.</li>
    <li>Paste into Kakobuy; reconcile variants before domestic payment (<a href="/blog/kakobuy-taobao/">Taobao</a>, <a href="/blog/kakobuy-weidian/">Weidian</a>, <a href="/blog/kakobuy-1688/">1688</a> primers).</li>
    <li>When warehouse photos land, judge the <em>item</em>, not the brand fantasy in the title—see <a href="/blog/kakobuy-spreadsheet-to-parcel-checklist/">Spreadsheet → parcel checklist</a>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Power users cross-check community timelines on <a href="/blog/kakobuy-spreadsheet-reddit/">Reddit</a> and compare third-party hubs via <a href="/blog/kakobuy-spreadsheet-hubs-compared/">spreadsheet hubs compared</a>, but those layers remain research—not substitutes for your inbound QC.
